  "brief": {
    "en": "The challenge was to maximize openness functionality within a limited floor plan.  Through \nthoughtful space planning, the interiors were reimagined to create a greater sense of flow and spaciousness \nwithout compromising comfort.  A minimal-chic aesthetic was achieved through the use of warm wood \nfinishes, clean lines, and carefully curated materials, resulting in a space that feels both inviting and \nsophisticated.\n"
  },
